Chapter: BvtPlayGump
  cites Uoaix chapter CompositePaging
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 UoaixPlays stage 7, the authoring gump: a button answer (0xB1) on the play gump is read as its [play command spoken,
 marked as from the gump; another gump's answer, or a button past the list, passes through. The gumps draw with art the
 1998 GUMPIDX holds (backing 2600, buttons 247/248 and 2151/2152).
  bpg-say : Text -> List Integer
  bpg-say (text) = gp-ascii (gp-put16 (gp-put16 (list-push (gp-put16 (gp-start 3) (9 + text-length text)) 0) 0) 3) text 0 (text-length text + 1)
  bpg-answer : Integer, Integer -> List Integer
  bpg-answer (gump) (button) = gp-put32 (gp-put32 (gp-put32 (gp-put32 (gp-put16 [#B1] 23) 7) gump) button) 0
  bvt-play-gump : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-play-gump (unused) = let start = cpy-gump-answer (bpg-answer cpy-gump-id 6)
    in let other = bpg-answer #DEC0 6
    in let past = bpg-answer cpy-gump-id 11
    in let layout = cp-gump-rows (cp-play-labels cpy-gump-commands 0 []) 2151 2152 60 0 ""
    in let removing = cp-decor-gump-answer (bpg-answer cp-decor-gump-id 2)
    in let beyond = cp-decor-gump-answer (bpg-answer cp-decor-gump-id 9)
    in let raise = cp-speech-answer (bpg-answer cp-land-gump-id 6) cp-land-gump-id cp-land-commands
    in let off-list = cp-speech-answer (bpg-answer cp-land-gump-id 16) cp-land-gump-id cp-land-commands in act
    print-line-uni ("PLAYGUMP start=" & show (list-length start) & " mark=" & show (list-at start 3))
    a <- bvt-check "the play gump's button 6 is [play start, spoken from the gump (cpy-gump-answer)" (cpy-request start & cpy-arg start [115, 116, 97, 114, 116] & cpy-gumped start & cpy-gump-request (bpg-say "[play gump"))
    b <- bvt-check "another gump's answer and a button past the list pass through unchanged; typed speech is not from the gump" (list-at (cpy-gump-answer other) 0 == #B1 & list-at (cpy-gump-answer past) 0 == #B1 & not (cpy-gumped (bpg-say "[play start")))
    c <- bvt-check "the gumps use the 1998 client's art: backing 2600, buttons 247/248 and 2151/2152, a button per command" (cp-gump-back == 2600 & cp-gump-button == 247 & cp-gump-pressed == 248 & text-contains layout "2151 2152 1 0 10 }")
    d <- bvt-check "the decorator gump's button 2 is the menu's choice 2 (remove), a 0x7D the menu handler takes; button 9 passes through" (cp-decor-choice-request removing & gp-u16 removing 7 == 2 & list-at beyond 0 == #B1)
    e <- bvt-check "the land page's button 6 speaks [raise 1, which the land tools take; button 16 passes through" (gld-word raise == "[raise" & gld-arg raise == "1" & list-at raise 3 == cpy-gump-mark & list-at off-list 0 == #B1)
    a + b + c + d + e
  end
